Calling `opencodeConsole('<go id>')` for five of the OpenCode Go ids my subscription serves routes the request through `@ai-sdk/openai-compatible` with a model id the SDK does not know. The SDK then uses `maxOutputTokens` in compatibility mode and limits the output to 4096 tokens. There is no error: the call succeeds, `finishReason` is `length`, and the only signal is a warning on stderr:

