### What happened

The mobile engine sends control references without their snapshot version, so agent-device cannot check whether a tap uses an old screen capture.

A control reference such as `@e1` identifies an element in a captured screen. `refsGeneration` identifies that capture's version. For version 7, the command must send `@e1~s7`.

